   "stem": {
      "text": "Find the radius of convergence of the power series \\( \\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty} \\frac{2^{n}(x-1)^{n}}{3^{n}\\,n^{2}} \\)."
   },
   "answer_key": {
      "form": "symbolic",
      "mathjson": [
         "Rational",
         3,
         2
      ]
   },
   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "For the ratio test, \\( \\left|\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}\\right| = \\frac{2 n^{2} \\left|{x - 1}\\right|}{3 \\left(n + 1\\right)^{2}} \\).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Divide",
            [
               "Multiply",
               2,
               [
                  "Multiply",
                  [
                     "Power",
                     "n",
                     2
                  ],
                  [
                     "Abs",
                     [
                        "Add",
                        "x",
                        -1
                     ]
                  ]
               ]
            ],
            [
               "Multiply",
               3,
               [
                  "Power",
                  [
                     "Add",
                     "n",
                     1
                  ],
                  2
               ]
            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "As \\( n \\to \\infty \\), the limit of this ratio is \\( \\frac{2 \\left|{x - 1}\\right|}{3} \\).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Divide",
            [
               "Multiply",
               2,
               [
                  "Abs",
                  [
                     "Add",
                     "x",
                     -1
                  ]
               ]
            ],
            3
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "The series converges when \\( \\frac{2 \\left|{x - 1}\\right|}{3} < 1 \\), that is, when \\( \\left|x - 1\\right| < \\frac{3}{2} \\).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Rational",
            3,
            2
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 4,
         "text": "The radius of convergence is \\( R = \\frac{3}{2} \\).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Rational",
            3,
            2
         ]
      }
